      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've personally wanted to do this for a while but it presents some technical hurdles. \nIn particular, Windows isn't super great at multiplexing sound out. We could do this, but we'd have to create a new output application that plays on the desktop versus the headset, which we don't want to mess with. It'd be pretty disorienting to pull your stream camera out and then suddenly your listening location is different!\nThere might be some clever solutions here but it isn't on the immediate investigation list. In short, this is a \"harder than you might think, but good idea, we'll get to it eventually\" item. \nThanks for the post!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
