      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: i figured as much that there would need to be some kind of audio magic needed to make it that you as the user can still hear correctly when providing directional audio to the camera\na possible work around, while shoddy, might me to have a configurable option to set the audio to \"mono\" while the camera is active\nthis would remove being able to tell which way sound is coming from but may be a better solution for the user than reversing the audio",
